            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Before the new one: say the Marathi for to sprain, then the Marathi for to swell."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 1,
          "type": "input",
          "title": "You'll want to know: चटका बसणे",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "चटका बसणे — caṭkā basṇe — \"to get a burn\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "गरम तव्याला हात लागला आणि चटका बसला. garam tavyālā hāt lāglā āṇi caṭkā baslā. My hand touched the hot griddle and I got burnt."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Past (to him …): त्याला चटका बसला, tyālā caṭkā baslā."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Dative: मला चटका बसला. Also a sudden pang of grief."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "चटका बसणे (caṭkā basṇe) is a Marathi phrase built on चटका, which CDIAL lists as Marathi caṭkā, \"glow\", under caṭa (CDIAL 4570), with बसणे."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 3,
          "type": "notice",
          "title": "What you've built",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "One more word for describing what you lived and felt."
            }
          ]
        },
